  "caveat": "The paper describes lunar training data in the southern polar cap. All current reference scene meshes are northern. This supports geographic separation from the reported lunar-adaptation data, conditional on that description matching the released checkpoint. Exact checkpoint training split files are absent; full pretraining and checkpoint-specific overlap remain unverified. Shared global LOLA terrain source and simulation dependence remain. This is not an accuracy or novelty result."
